{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092","id":3826887580,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7kGauc","number":2092,"title":"Trae 云端被 Anthropic 地区限制","user":{"login":"yang-1027","id":58029886,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MDI5ODg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58029886?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027","html_url":"https://github.com/yang-1027","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-01-18T15:04:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T09:36:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"#### 环境信息\n\n- 系统：macOS（Apple Silicon）  \n- Trae 版本：3.5.21（ICUBE_APP_VERSION=3.5.21，ICUBE_VSCODE_VERSION=1.104.3）  \n- 安装来源：Trae 官方安装包  \n\n#### 问题概述\n\n我在 Trae 中通过「模型管理 → 添加模型」集成 AWS Bedrock 的 Anthropic 模型（Claude-4.5-Sonnet 系列），配置如下：\n\n- 服务商：AWS  \n- 模型：Claude-4.5-Sonnet（内部对应 `us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0` 或 `us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0`）  \n- 区域：`us-east-1`  \n- 访问密钥 / 私钥：使用的是我自己 AWS 账户下、已开通 Bedrock + Anthropic 访问权限的 AK/SK（已在日志中隐藏）\n在 Trae 的 Chat / Builder 中选择这个 AWS 模型对话时，界面会提示：\n\n> 模型请求失败，请稍后重试 (4054)\n\n看上去像是 Trae 的统一错误码。\n\n#### 实际错误（来自 Trae 日志）\n\n我在本机执行命令查看 Trae 日志：\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Library/Application\\ Support/Trae/logs\ngrep -R \"Anthropic\" -n .\ngrep -R \"模型请求失败\" -n .\n```\n\n在 `logs/20260118T202138/window1/renderer.log` 中看到了更详细的报错（摘录关键部分，已去掉隐私信息）：\n\n```text\nValidationException: Access to Anthropic models is not allowed from unsupported\ncountries, regions, or territories. Please refer to\nhttps://www.anthropic.com/supported-countries for more information on the\ncountries and regions Anthropic currently supports. (4028)\n```\n同一文件中的埋点日志也记录了相同错误：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_model\": \"aws//anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0\",\n  \"agent_type\": \"builder\",\n  \"provider\": \"aws\",\n  \"error_code\": 4028,\n  \"error_message\": \"ValidationException: Access to Anthropic models is not allowed from unsupported countries, regions, or territories. Please refer to https://www.anthropic.com/supported-countries for more information on the countries and regions Anthropic currently supports.\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\n此外，环境变量里能看到 Trae 进程启动时带了这些配置（只截关键字段）：\n\n```text\nANTHROPIC_MODEL=us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0\nANTHROPIC_PROVIDER=bedrock\nAWS_REGION=us-east-1\nAPP_REGION=SG\nCLAUDE_CODE_USE_BEDROCK=1\n```\n\n综合来看：\n\n- Trae 在调用 AWS Bedrock 的 Anthropic 模型时，收到的是 **AWS 返回的 `ValidationException`（错误码 4028）**，说明 Anthropic 认为当前请求来源的「国家 / 地区」不在支持列表中；\n- 而在 UI 上，这个错误被 Trae 包装成了「模型请求失败，请稍后重试 (4054)」。\n\n#### 对比：本地 Java SDK 调用是正常的\n\n同一台机器、同一个 AWS 账户、同一个区域 `us-east-1`，我用 AWS 官方 Java SDK 直接调用 Bedrock 的同一个 Anthropic 模型是可以正常返回结果的。示意代码（已去掉真实 AK/SK）：\n\n- 文件路径：`shifeng-ai/src/main/java/com/shifeng/ai/llm/aws/AwsBedrockDemo.java`\n- 使用的模型 ID 示例：\n  - `us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0`\n  - `us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0`\n- 区域：`Region.of(\"us-east-1\")`  \n- 客户端：`BedrockRuntimeClient` / `BedrockRuntimeAsyncClient`\n\n在这个 Java Demo 中，同样的 AK/SK、同样的模型 ID 和区域，可以持续稳定地拿到 Anthropic 的响应，没有任何地区限制错误。\n\n这说明：\n\n- **我的 AWS 账号已经正确开通了 Anthropic on Bedrock 的访问权限**；  \n- 从我本机直连 Bedrock（SDK 调用）的链路是被 Anthropic 允许的；  \n- 问题只出现在 Trae 这条从 Trae → 云端 → AWS 的调用链上。\n\n#### 我的推断\n\n从上述日志和环境变量推断：\n\n- Trae 在集成 AWS 模型时，采用的是「客户端 → Trae 云端 → AWS Bedrock」的模式，而不是让我本机直接连 AWS；\n- 日志中的 `APP_REGION=SG` 等信息说明 Trae 的云端服务节点极有可能在新加坡等地区；\n- Anthropic 对「来自哪些国家/地区的请求可以访问其模型」有严格限制，当它看到请求来源于 Trae 云端所在地区时，返回了 `ValidationException`；\n- Trae 前端把这个错误统一映射成了 `(4054)`，导致用户在界面上只看到一个泛化错误。\n\n简而言之：\n\n> 同一套 AWS 配置，在本地 Java SDK 中调用 Anthropic 模型完全正常；  \n> 但在 Trae 中通过「AWS + Anthropic」模型调用时，由于 Trae 云端的请求来源地区不被 Anthropic 支持，导致永远返回 `ValidationException`，用户无法在 Trae 内使用 AWS 上的 Anthropic 模型。\n\n#### 期望行为\n\n- 期望 Trae 官方：\n  1. 明确文档中说明「在某些国家/地区，通过 Trae 云端调用 AWS Anthropic 模型可能受到 Anthropic 地区限制」，并对错误 `(4054)` 给出更清晰的提示（例如直接展示上述 `ValidationException` 的原始信息），方便用户自查；\n  2. 评估是否可以：\n     - 为 AWS 模型提供**纯本地直连**模式（客户端直接用用户提供的 AK/SK 调 Bedrock，不经 Trae 云端转发）；或者\n     - 调整云端调用路径 / 区域，使之符合 Anthropic 的支持地区策略；\n  3. 在模型管理界面中，对「AWS + Anthropic」模型在不支持地区时给出显式的禁用或警告，而不是简单的「模型请求失败，请稍后重试」。\n\n#### 复现步骤（Steps to Reproduce）\n\n1. 在 macOS 上安装 Trae（当前版本 3.5.21，稳定版）。\n2. 在 Trae 中：\n   - 打开「头像 → 设置 → Trae AI → 模型管理」；\n   - 添加自定义模型：\n     - 服务商：AWS\n     - 模型：Claude-4.5-Sonnet（内部为 `us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0` 等）\n     - 区域：`us-east-1`\n     - 访问密钥 / 私钥：填写拥有 Bedrock & Anthropic 访问权限的 AWS AK/SK。\n3. 在 Chat 或 Builder 中选择该自定义 AWS 模型，随便发一个简单问题。\n4. 观察：\n   - UI 提示「模型请求失败，请稍后重试 (4054)」；\n   - 在 `~/Library/Application Support/Trae/logs/.../renderer.log` 中可以看到 `ValidationException: Access to Anthropic models is not allowed from unsupported countries, regions, or territories. (4028)` 的原始错误。\n\n#### 补充说明\n\n- 为保护安全，本文未附上具体 AK/SK；  \n- 如有需要，我可以在私有渠道提供更完整的日志片段，或按官方要求采集 sysdiagnose/更多调试信息。  \n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3767201658","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092#issuecomment-3767201658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2092","id":3767201658,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7giu96","user":{"login":"yang-1027","id":58029886,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MDI5ODg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58029886?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027","html_url":"https://github.com/yang-1027","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yang-1027/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T09:01:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T09:01:42Z","body":"<img width=\"427\" height=\"451\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/asset